I presume that you are talking about the landmines and pits in the
vault and not other random traps on the level.

If you're feeling dexterous, you can give a try at #untrap'ping the
landmines and avoiding the creation of further pits.  My personal
favorite is to fly over the traps and set them off with air currents
while riding a dragon.  Another option is casting create monster and
letting other monsters set off the traps for you and then going in to
clean up the gold.  Usually by this point in the game I have a ring or
boots of levitation so I fall into the pits, pick up the gold, and
then levitate out.  There are many annoyances in the game and I'd have
to say that climbing out of pits is among the most tolerable so I
won't go too far out of my way to find a more convenient way to clear
out the vault.

